Description: Negotiate an X11 stereo window place before changing its destination
 .
 Announce version 7 and send serialled one-view size proposals. Hold the old destination until the client answers and its frame arrives. Keep native ConfigureNotify and XSync repaint semantics separate, and apply normal hints in one-view units.
